SCOREOS
Version: 2.1.0
Platform: Raspberry Pi 4 and Raspberry Pi 5
Operating System: Raspberry Pi OS Trixie (Debian 13)
Bluetooth: BlueZ
Status: Working development build

Features:
- Automatic BLE advertisement
- Android Play-Cricket support
- iPhone Play-Cricket support
- Live packet parsing
- Persistent Arduino connection
- Automatic startup after reboot
- Camera recording and automatic highlights
